# File: bigocrpdf/src/bigocrpdf/ui/output_dialog.py, line: 79
#: src/bigocrpdf/ui/output_dialog.py:27
msgid ""
"Controls the compression applied to images inside the PDF. Lower quality means smaller files but "
"some detail is lost. 'Keep Original' preserves images exactly as they are.\n"
"\n"
"The last option, 'Black & White (JBIG2)', converts all pages to pure black and white using JBIG2 — "
"the most compact format available. Ideal for text-only documents, but all color is lost."
msgstr ""
"Juhib PDF-is olevatele piltidele rakendatavat tihendamist. Madalam kvaliteet tähendab väiksemaid "
"faile, kuid osa detailidest läheb kaduma. 'Säilita originaal' hoiab pildid täpselt sellisena, nagu "
"nad on.\n"
"\n"
"Viimane valik 'Mustvalge (JBIG2)' teisendab kõik leheküljed puhtaks mustvalgeks JBIG2 abil — kõige "
"kompaktsem saadaval formaat. Ideaalne ainult tekstiga dokumentide jaoks, kuid kogu värv kaob."
